 ('ENT_REN_REHAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 39th Shem angel (root RHO), ruling Libra 10-15° under Luna; office is the healing of body and mind and filial love.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_IEIAZEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 40th Shem angel (root YYZ), ruling Libra 15-20° under Saturn; office is consolation, deliverance from captivity, and inspiration of the arts.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHAHEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 41st Shem angel (root HHH), ruling Libra 20-25° under Jupiter; office is the protection and zeal of missionaries and martyrs.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MIKAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 42nd Shem angel (root MYK), ruling Libra 25-30° under Mars; office is statecraft, diplomacy, and the unmasking of plots (distinct from the archangel Michael).','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_VEULIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 43rd Shem angel (root VVL), ruling Scorpio 0-5° under Sol; office is prosperity, peace, and the success of enterprises.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_YELAHIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 44th Shem angel (root YLH), ruling Scorpio 5-10° under Venus; office is victory in just war and protection of warriors and magistrates.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_SEHALIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 45th Shem angel (root SAL), ruling Scorpio 10-15° under Mercury; office is the revival of vital force and the quickening of plants.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ARIEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 46th Shem angel (root ORY), ruling Scorpio 15-20° under Luna; office is the revelation of hidden treasures and secrets of nature.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ASALIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 47th Shem angel (root OShL), ruling Scorpio 20-25° under Saturn; office is the contemplation of divine justice and truth.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MIHAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 48th Shem angel (root MHSh), ruling Scorpio 25-30° under Jupiter; office is conjugal fidelity, friendship, and procreation (distinct from the archangel Michael).','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_VEHUEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 49th Shem angel (root VHV), ruling Sagittarius 0-5° under Mars; office is elevation of the spirit, magnanimity, and literary inspiration.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_DANIEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 50th Shem angel (root DNY), ruling Sagittarius 5-10° under Sol; office is eloquence and merciful judgment (distinct from the prophet Daniel).','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHASIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 51st Shem angel (root HHSh), ruling Sagittarius 10-15° under Venus; office is occult knowledge of natural medicine and alchemy.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_IMAMIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 52nd Shem angel (root OMM), ruling Sagittarius 15-20° under Mercury; office is the liberation of prisoners and victory over foes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_NANAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 53rd Shem angel (root NNA), ruling Sagittarius 20-25° under Luna; office is the higher sciences, theology, and contemplation.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_NITHAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 54th Shem angel (root NYT), ruling Sagittarius 25-30° under Saturn; office is the endurance of legitimate authority, grace, and long life.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MEBAHIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 55th Shem angel (root MBH), ruling Capricorn 0-5° under Jupiter; office is offspring, the propagation of piety, and clarity of conscience.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_POYEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 56th Shem angel (root PVY), ruling Capricorn 5-10° under Mars; office is good fortune, public favour, and fulfilment of wishes.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_NEMAMIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 57th Shem angel (root NMM), ruling Capricorn 10-15° under Sol; office is the success of commanders and just causes and the deliverance of captives.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_YEIALEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 58th Shem angel (root YYL), ruling Capricorn 15-20° under Venus; office is healing of the eyes and mind and firmness of judgment.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HARAHEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 59th Shem angel (root HRH), ruling Capricorn 20-25° under Mercury; office is knowledge, the guardianship of archives, and the prosperity of letters.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MITZRAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 60th Shem angel (root MTzR), ruling Capricorn 25-30° under Luna; office is relief from mental affliction, reconciliation, and just elevation.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_UMABEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 61st Shem angel (root VMB), ruling Aquarius 0-5° under Saturn; office is astronomy, natural philosophy, and the cultivation of friendship.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_IAH_HEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 62nd Shem angel (root YHH), ruling Aquarius 5-10° under Jupiter; office is the contemplative life, philosophical wisdom, and peaceful retreat.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ANAUEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 63rd Shem angel (root ANV), ruling Aquarius 10-15° under Mars; office is the prosperity of trade, the safety of commerce, and concord.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MEHIEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 64th Shem angel (root MHY), ruling Aquarius 15-20° under Sol; office is the protection and inspiration of writers, professors, and orators.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_DAMABIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 65th Shem angel (root DMB), ruling Aquarius 20-25° under Venus; office is safety at sea, success in maritime enterprise, and the gaining of wisdom.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MANAKEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 66th Shem angel (root MNQ), ruling Aquarius 25-30° under Mercury; office is reconciliation, the soothing of wrath, and the calming of dreams.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_EYAEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 67th Shem angel (root AYO), ruling Pisces 0-5° under Luna; office is comfort in hardship, esoteric knowledge, and contemplation of eternity.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HABUHIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 68th Shem angel (root HBV), ruling Pisces 5-10° under Saturn; office is the cure of illness, the fecundity of the soil, and abundant harvests.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ROCHEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 69th Shem angel (root RAH), ruling Pisces 10-15° under Jupiter; office is the recovery of lost goods, the discovery of thieves, and rightful inheritance.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_JABAMIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 70th Shem angel (root YBM), ruling Pisces 15-20° under Mars; office is the regeneration of nature, alchemical transmutation, and spiritual renewal.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAIAIEL','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 71st Shem angel (root HYY), ruling Pisces 20-25° under Sol; office is bravery, martial triumph, and the deliverance of the just.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MUMIAH','SRC_KIRCHER_OEDIPUS','The 72nd and final Shem angel (root MVM), ruling Pisces 25-30° under Venus; office is the completion of works, recovery of health, and the cycle of death and renewal.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_AGIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence (directing angel) of Saturn, its name drawn from the Saturn magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Saturn Spirit Zazel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ZAZEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Saturn from the Saturn magic square in Agrippa II.22, the more dangerous counterpart to the Intelligence Agiel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_IOPHIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence of Jupiter (Yophiel), its name drawn from the Jupiter magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Jupiter Spirit Hismael.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HISMAEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Jupiter from the Jupiter magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Iophiel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_GRAPHIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence of Mars, its name drawn from the Mars magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Mars Spirit Bartzabel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_BARTZABEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Mars from the Mars magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Graphiel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_NAKHIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence of Sol, its name drawn from the Sun magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the solar Spirit Sorath.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_SORATH','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Sol from the Sun magic square in Agrippa II.22 (its name summing to 666), counterpart to the Intelligence Nakhiel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAGIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence of Venus, its name drawn from the Venus magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Venus Spirit Kedemel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_KEDEMEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Venus from the Venus magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Hagiel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_TIRIEL','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence of Mercury, its name drawn from the Mercury magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Mercury Spirit Taphthartharath.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_TAPHTHARTHARATH','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Mercury from the Mercury magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Tiriel.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_MALKAH_BE_TARSHISHIM','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Intelligence (intelligence of intelligences) of Luna, her long name drawn from the Moon magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the lunar Spirit Chashmodai.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_CHASHMODAI','SRC_AGRIPPA_OCCULTA','The Spirit (raw force) of Luna from the Moon magic square in Agrippa II.22 (cognate with the demon Asmodeus), counterpart to the lunar Intelligence.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_ARATRON','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Saturn governing 49 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include alchemy, magic, familiars, invisibility, and longevity.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_BETHOR','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Jupiter governing 42 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include commanding aerial spirits, granting dignities and treasures, and prolonging life.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_PHALEG','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Mars governing 35 of the 196 Olympic provinces, called the Lord of War, presiding over matters martial.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_OCH','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Sol governing 28 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include alchemy/gold, medicine, perfect health, and longevity.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAGITH','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Venus governing 21 of the 196 Olympic provinces, presiding over love and beauty and bestowing beauty and faithful familiars.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_OPHIEL','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Mercury governing 14 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include the Mercurial arts, all sciences, and the philosopher''s stone.','primary text attestation'),
 ('ENT_REN_PHUL','SRC_ARBATEL','The Olympic Spirit of Luna governing 7 of the 196 Olympic provinces, called the Lord of the Powers of the Moon, presiding over silver, water-spirits, and healing.','primary text attestation');
