 ('ENT_REN_MENADEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 36th Shem angel (root MNT), ruling Virgo 25-30° under Mercury; office is steadfast work, vocation, and the return of what is lost.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ANIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 37th Shem angel (root ANY), ruling Libra 0-5° under Venus; office is breaking impediments and protection in adversity.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAAMIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 38th Shem angel (root HOM), ruling Libra 5-10° under Mercury; office is religious worship and the acquisition of esoteric truth.'),
 ('ENT_REN_REHAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 39th Shem angel (root RHO), ruling Libra 10-15° under Luna; office is the healing of body and mind and filial love.'),
 ('ENT_REN_IEIAZEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 40th Shem angel (root YYZ), ruling Libra 15-20° under Saturn; office is consolation, deliverance from captivity, and inspiration of the arts.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHAHEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 41st Shem angel (root HHH), ruling Libra 20-25° under Jupiter; office is the protection and zeal of missionaries and martyrs.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MIKAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 42nd Shem angel (root MYK), ruling Libra 25-30° under Mars; office is statecraft, diplomacy, and the unmasking of plots (distinct from the archangel Michael).'),
 ('ENT_REN_VEULIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 43rd Shem angel (root VVL), ruling Scorpio 0-5° under Sol; office is prosperity, peace, and the success of enterprises.'),
 ('ENT_REN_YELAHIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 44th Shem angel (root YLH), ruling Scorpio 5-10° under Venus; office is victory in just war and protection of warriors and magistrates.'),
 ('ENT_REN_SEHALIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 45th Shem angel (root SAL), ruling Scorpio 10-15° under Mercury; office is the revival of vital force and the quickening of plants.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ARIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 46th Shem angel (root ORY), ruling Scorpio 15-20° under Luna; office is the revelation of hidden treasures and secrets of nature.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ASALIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 47th Shem angel (root OShL), ruling Scorpio 20-25° under Saturn; office is the contemplation of divine justice and truth.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MIHAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 48th Shem angel (root MHSh), ruling Scorpio 25-30° under Jupiter; office is conjugal fidelity, friendship, and procreation (distinct from the archangel Michael).'),
 ('ENT_REN_VEHUEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 49th Shem angel (root VHV), ruling Sagittarius 0-5° under Mars; office is elevation of the spirit, magnanimity, and literary inspiration.'),
 ('ENT_REN_DANIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 50th Shem angel (root DNY), ruling Sagittarius 5-10° under Sol; office is eloquence and merciful judgment (distinct from the prophet Daniel).'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHASIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 51st Shem angel (root HHSh), ruling Sagittarius 10-15° under Venus; office is occult knowledge of natural medicine and alchemy.'),
 ('ENT_REN_IMAMIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 52nd Shem angel (root OMM), ruling Sagittarius 15-20° under Mercury; office is the liberation of prisoners and victory over foes.'),
 ('ENT_REN_NANAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 53rd Shem angel (root NNA), ruling Sagittarius 20-25° under Luna; office is the higher sciences, theology, and contemplation.'),
 ('ENT_REN_NITHAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 54th Shem angel (root NYT), ruling Sagittarius 25-30° under Saturn; office is the endurance of legitimate authority, grace, and long life.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MEBAHIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 55th Shem angel (root MBH), ruling Capricorn 0-5° under Jupiter; office is offspring, the propagation of piety, and clarity of conscience.'),
 ('ENT_REN_POYEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 56th Shem angel (root PVY), ruling Capricorn 5-10° under Mars; office is good fortune, public favour, and fulfilment of wishes.'),
 ('ENT_REN_NEMAMIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 57th Shem angel (root NMM), ruling Capricorn 10-15° under Sol; office is the success of commanders and just causes and the deliverance of captives.'),
 ('ENT_REN_YEIALEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 58th Shem angel (root YYL), ruling Capricorn 15-20° under Venus; office is healing of the eyes and mind and firmness of judgment.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HARAHEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 59th Shem angel (root HRH), ruling Capricorn 20-25° under Mercury; office is knowledge, the guardianship of archives, and the prosperity of letters.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MITZRAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 60th Shem angel (root MTzR), ruling Capricorn 25-30° under Luna; office is relief from mental affliction, reconciliation, and just elevation.'),
 ('ENT_REN_UMABEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 61st Shem angel (root VMB), ruling Aquarius 0-5° under Saturn; office is astronomy, natural philosophy, and the cultivation of friendship.'),
 ('ENT_REN_IAH_HEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 62nd Shem angel (root YHH), ruling Aquarius 5-10° under Jupiter; office is the contemplative life, philosophical wisdom, and peaceful retreat.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ANAUEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 63rd Shem angel (root ANV), ruling Aquarius 10-15° under Mars; office is the prosperity of trade, the safety of commerce, and concord.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MEHIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 64th Shem angel (root MHY), ruling Aquarius 15-20° under Sol; office is the protection and inspiration of writers, professors, and orators.'),
 ('ENT_REN_DAMABIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 65th Shem angel (root DMB), ruling Aquarius 20-25° under Venus; office is safety at sea, success in maritime enterprise, and the gaining of wisdom.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MANAKEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 66th Shem angel (root MNQ), ruling Aquarius 25-30° under Mercury; office is reconciliation, the soothing of wrath, and the calming of dreams.'),
 ('ENT_REN_EYAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 67th Shem angel (root AYO), ruling Pisces 0-5° under Luna; office is comfort in hardship, esoteric knowledge, and contemplation of eternity.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HABUHIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 68th Shem angel (root HBV), ruling Pisces 5-10° under Saturn; office is the cure of illness, the fecundity of the soil, and abundant harvests.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ROCHEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 69th Shem angel (root RAH), ruling Pisces 10-15° under Jupiter; office is the recovery of lost goods, the discovery of thieves, and rightful inheritance.'),
 ('ENT_REN_JABAMIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 70th Shem angel (root YBM), ruling Pisces 15-20° under Mars; office is the regeneration of nature, alchemical transmutation, and spiritual renewal.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAIAIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 71st Shem angel (root HYY), ruling Pisces 20-25° under Sol; office is bravery, martial triumph, and the deliverance of the just.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MUMIAH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The 72nd and final Shem angel (root MVM), ruling Pisces 25-30° under Venus; office is the completion of works, recovery of health, and the cycle of death and renewal.'),
 ('ENT_REN_AGIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence (directing angel) of Saturn, its name drawn from the Saturn magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Saturn Spirit Zazel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ZAZEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Saturn from the Saturn magic square in Agrippa II.22, the more dangerous counterpart to the Intelligence Agiel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_IOPHIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence of Jupiter (Yophiel), its name drawn from the Jupiter magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Jupiter Spirit Hismael.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HISMAEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Jupiter from the Jupiter magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Iophiel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_GRAPHIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence of Mars, its name drawn from the Mars magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Mars Spirit Bartzabel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_BARTZABEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Mars from the Mars magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Graphiel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_NAKHIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence of Sol, its name drawn from the Sun magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the solar Spirit Sorath.'),
 ('ENT_REN_SORATH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Sol from the Sun magic square in Agrippa II.22 (its name summing to 666), counterpart to the Intelligence Nakhiel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAGIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence of Venus, its name drawn from the Venus magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Venus Spirit Kedemel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_KEDEMEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Venus from the Venus magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Hagiel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_TIRIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence of Mercury, its name drawn from the Mercury magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the Mercury Spirit Taphthartharath.'),
 ('ENT_REN_TAPHTHARTHARATH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Mercury from the Mercury magic square in Agrippa II.22, counterpart to the Intelligence Tiriel.'),
 ('ENT_REN_MALKAH_BE_TARSHISHIM','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Intelligence (intelligence of intelligences) of Luna, her long name drawn from the Moon magic square in Agrippa II.22; paired with the lunar Spirit Chashmodai.'),
 ('ENT_REN_CHASHMODAI','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Spirit (raw force) of Luna from the Moon magic square in Agrippa II.22 (cognate with the demon Asmodeus), counterpart to the lunar Intelligence.'),
 ('ENT_REN_ARATRON','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Saturn governing 49 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include alchemy, magic, familiars, invisibility, and longevity.'),
 ('ENT_REN_BETHOR','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Jupiter governing 42 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include commanding aerial spirits, granting dignities and treasures, and prolonging life.'),
 ('ENT_REN_PHALEG','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Mars governing 35 of the 196 Olympic provinces, called the Lord of War, presiding over matters martial.'),
 ('ENT_REN_OCH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Sol governing 28 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include alchemy/gold, medicine, perfect health, and longevity.'),
 ('ENT_REN_HAGITH','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Venus governing 21 of the 196 Olympic provinces, presiding over love and beauty and bestowing beauty and faithful familiars.'),
 ('ENT_REN_OPHIEL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Mercury governing 14 of the 196 Olympic provinces; offices include the Mercurial arts, all sciences, and the philosopher''s stone.'),
 ('ENT_REN_PHUL','PER_EARLY_MODERN_OCCULT','The Olympic Spirit of Luna governing 7 of the 196 Olympic provinces, called the Lord of the Powers of the Moon, presiding over silver, water-spirits, and healing.');
