 ('ENT_REN_VEHUIAH','presides_over','ENT_MAGIC','medium','Vehuiah''s office of willpower and banishing evil spirits places it over operative magic.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_JELIEL','presides_over','ENT_LOVE','medium','Jeliel''s office is love and conjugal fidelity.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_SITAEL','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','medium','Sitael''s office is protection against adversity.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_ELEMIAH','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','medium','Elemiah protects travellers and sailors and exposes traitors.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_MAHASIAH','presides_over','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Mahasiah''s office is ease in learning the liberal sciences.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_LELAHEL','presides_over','ENT_HEALING','medium','Lelahel''s office is the healing of illness and light.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_ACHAIAH','presides_over','ENT_HIDDEN_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Achaiah''s office is the discovery of the secrets of nature.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_CAHETEL','presides_over','ENT_AGRICULTURE','medium','Cahetel''s office is agricultural abundance and divine blessing.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_ALADIAH','presides_over','ENT_HEALING','medium','Aladiah''s office is healing and the cure of plague.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_LAUVIAH_11','presides_over','ENT_WAR','medium','Lauviah''s office is victory and success against enemies.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHAIAH','presides_over','ENT_REVELATION','medium','Hahaiah''s office is the revelation of mysteries through dreams.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_MEBAHEL','presides_over','ENT_JUSTICE','medium','Mebahel''s office is justice and protection of the oppressed.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_HARIEL','presides_over','ENT_CRAFT','medium','Hariel''s office is skill in useful arts, sciences, and inventions.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_HEKAMIAH','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','medium','Hekamiah''s office is protection of rulers and deliverance from treachery.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_LAUVIAH_17','presides_over','ENT_PROPHECY','medium','The second Lauviah''s office is prophetic inspiration and revelation through dreams.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_CALIEL','presides_over','ENT_JUSTICE','medium','Caliel''s office is justice and the exposure of guilt in lawsuits.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_LEUVIAH','presides_over','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Leuviah''s office is expansive memory and intelligence.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_NELCHAEL','presides_over','ENT_KNOWLEDGE','medium','Nelchael''s office is learning, astronomy, and mathematics.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_YEIAYEL','presides_over','ENT_FORTUNE','medium','Yeiayel''s office is fame, fortune, and success in commerce.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_MELAHEL','presides_over','ENT_HEALING','medium','Melahel''s office is healing through medicinal plants.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_HAHEUIAH','presides_over','ENT_PROTECTION','medium','Haheuiah''s office is protection of exiles, fugitives, and refuge-seekers.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_NITH_HAIAH','presides_over','ENT_MAGIC','medium','Nith-Haiah''s office is wisdom, the occult arts, and magic.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_HAAIAH','presides_over','ENT_WISDOM','medium','Haaiah''s office is political wisdom, diplomacy, and truth in judgment.',''),
 ('ENT_REN_YERATHEL','presides_over','ENT_TRUTH','medium','Yerathel''s office is the propagation of light and truth.',''),
